<title>JAPAN: Hokuriku Denwa - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hokuriku Denwa - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.33		vs	    5.56</p>
<p> Operating    loss 95 million	 vs    loss 93 million</p>
<p> Current	loss 51 million	 vs    loss 42 million</p>
<p> Net	    loss 46 million	 vs    loss 40 million</p>
